# Experiment E: retrieval modes (graph-only, S3-Vectors-only, fused) on tier S data. Phase 15 Wave 2.
# UNAPPROVED and UNEXECUTED. Format: scripts/README.md, "Experiment manifest contract".
# No spaces in values.
# PLACEHOLDERS the human replaces before an approval record is written
# (the record binds the sha256 of the final file, so any edit needs a new record):
#   ACCOUNT_ID       123456789012 is the documented example, not a real account.
#   (DATASET_SNAPSHOT is filled: scholarchain-s-20261107-10dd7f34121b, reported by WO-4 and
#                    verified by the human.)
#   OUTPUT_ROOT      /abs/outside/repo/... is a placeholder path; pick a durable directory
#                    outside the repository.
# Limits (tier S caps of decision P15-1: 90 min, 64 clients, 20000 tasks):
#   MAX_TASKS 1500   351 year-window questions x 3 modes = 1,053 requests (run.sh REQUESTS 1053; the
#                    entry point refuses a smaller MAX_TASKS). One client, interleaved per question
#                    with a rotated mode order. No OpenSearch exists in the Terraform, so there is no
#                    fourth mode.
#   MAX_MINUTES 60   the client gets MAX_MINUTES minus 10 (at least 20 required).
#   MAX_CONCURRENCY 2 bounds the client; the run uses 1.
# Retrieval only, with the offline stub answer model (P15-4): no Bedrock charge.
# COST (HOURLY_BURN_USD and SPEND_CEILING_USD): session 2 values from WO-10, infra/terraform/COST_ESTIMATE.md,
# section "Session 2 (services) hourly burn and HIGH", paragraph "Provisional experiment burns".
# HOURLY_BURN_USD 0.42 = steady 0.37 + load client 0.049, rounded up. Was 0.62 (tier M draft).
# SPEND_CEILING_USD 0.45: 0.42 x 60 min / 60 = 0.42, under the ceiling 0.45 (0.03 headroom). Was 0.80.
# The burn covers the experiment hours only; the S3 Vectors queries are cents.
# CAVEAT for the human: every rate behind the 0.37 steady burn is UNVERIFIED (memory; only the
# Fargate per-second rates are read anchors), so the value is the WO-10 figure, not a verified rate.
MANIFEST_VERSION=1
EXPERIMENT_ID=E
DESCRIPTION=retrieval-modes-graph-vector-fused-351-questions-x3-tier-s
ENVIRONMENT=course
REGION=us-east-2
ACCOUNT_ID=123456789012
DATASET_SNAPSHOT=scholarchain-s-20261107-10dd7f34121b
SIZE_TIER=S
MAX_MINUTES=60
MAX_CONCURRENCY=2
MAX_TASKS=1500
SPEND_CEILING_USD=0.45
HOURLY_BURN_USD=0.42
STOP_CONDITIONS=wall-clock,first-failure,spend-estimate
METRIC_NAMES=TargetResponseTime,RequestCount,HTTPCode_Target_5XX_Count,HTTPCode_ELB_5XX_Count,HealthyHostCount,DesiredTaskCount,RunningTaskCount,CPUUtilization,MemoryUtilization,MainRequestQueuePendingRequests,ReadThrottleEvents,WriteThrottleEvents,ConsumedReadCapacityUnits,ConsumedWriteCapacityUnits
METRIC_NAMESPACES=AWS/ApplicationELB,ECS/ContainerInsights,AWS/ECS,AWS/DynamoDB,AWS/Neptune
OUTPUT_ROOT=/abs/outside/repo/scholarchain-experiments
ENTRY_POINT=script:experiments/e-retrieval-modes/run.sh
